## 1. Section 2 densities -- symbolic identity check
   (1-c/n)^(b-1) - (1-rho)/(1-c/n)  simplifies to: 0

## 2. Section 4 direct algebraic check  H(t) = t^2/A
   (1-q(s))/(A-s) simplifies to: 1/A
   H(t) = t - (A-t)*Int  = t**2/A    (expect t**2/A)
   difference from t^2/A: 0
   integrand of phi_cond: exp(-c*t**2/A)/A
   Int_0^A ... dt  - Int_0^1 exp(-cA u^2) du  = 0

## 3. Section 6.3  --  delta correction
   (1-q_delta(u))/(1-u) = -delta*u + 1    (expect 1 - delta*u)
   H_delta(t) = -delta*t**3/2 + delta*t**2/2 + t**2
   H_delta - [t^2 + (delta/2) t^2 (1-t)] = 0

## 4. closed forms phi_U(c) and T_U(c)
   phi_U(c') = sqrt(pi)*erf(sqrt(cp))/(2*sqrt(cp))
   T_U(c')   = -1/(2*cp) + exp(-cp)/(2*cp) + sqrt(pi)*erf(sqrt(cp))/(2*sqrt(cp))
   T_U - [phi_U - (1-exp(-c'))/(2c')] = 0

